# synapse_fbs C++ headers

Generated with flatc {{ flatbuffers_version }}. Reflection schemas are included
under `bfbs/`. The archive also ships `topics.json` and
`include/synapse/topic_catalog.h` for canonical Zenoh keys, `TopicId`, root
table names, and payload types.

Use the archive through CMake and link `synapse_fbs::cpp`, or add `include/` to
the compiler include path directly.

Prefer `find_package` when the archive is downloaded, extracted, or installed
outside the project configure step:

```cmake
find_package(synapse_fbs {{ package_version }} CONFIG REQUIRED)

target_link_libraries(app PRIVATE synapse_fbs::cpp)
```

Set `CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH` to the extracted archive root, for example
`/path/to/synapse_fbs-cpp`.

Use `FetchContent` when the project should fetch the GitHub Release archive
directly.

```cmake
include(FetchContent)

FetchContent_Declare(
  synapse_fbs
  URL https://github.com/CogniPilot/synapse_fbs/releases/download/{{ release_name }}/synapse_fbs-cpp.tar.gz
  URL_HASH SHA256=<release sha256>
  DOWNLOAD_EXTRACT_TIMESTAMP TRUE
)
FetchContent_MakeAvailable(synapse_fbs)

target_link_libraries(app PRIVATE synapse_fbs::cpp)
```

```cpp
#include <synapse/topic_catalog.h>

const synapse_topic_info_t *topic = synapse_topic_by_name("VehicleHealth");
```
